        <!-- ==========================================================
             Sir ka manga hua khatma: center mein logo, us ke neeche
             fine print, aur aakhir mein qanooni links.

             Yeh sab ASAL TEXT hai, tasveer nahi -- is liye har size par
             saaf rehta hai, dark mode mein rang badal leta hai, aur agar
             Gmail tasveerein band kar de to bhi parha jata hai. Fine
             print ke liye tasveer istemal karna ghalti hoti.

             beehiiv ka apna footer (address + Unsubscribe) is ke NEECHE
             khud lagta hai. Us ka alignment beehiiv badalne nahi deta --
             maine template editor aur Settings dono dekhe.
             ========================================================== -->
        <tr>
          <td align="center" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="padding:34px 26px 0;font:400 14px/1.65 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#6b7683;text-align:center;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%;max-width:600px;">
            The <a href="https://trvler.co?utm_source=newsletter&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=welcome" target="_blank" style="color:#6b7683;text-decoration:underline;">Trvler.co</a>
            Magazine is a newly launched, independent Canadian travel-media publication aspiring to inspire
            travellers to discover extraordinary destinations, experience different cultures and see more of
            the world through original stories, videos and travel ideas.
          </td>
